On substituting the value of <math>a</math> in equation (7) it becomes—
{{block center|<math>\theta=\text{A}e^{\frac{-at}{\text{T}}}\ \sin\ \left(\frac{\pi t}{\text{T}}\sqrt{1-\frac{a^2}{\pi^2}+\beta}\right)</math>, . . . . (8)}}
